{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261122/photo/bkn-20261122203001119-1122_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261122203001\"/><p>菲律賓有現職警員參與綁架。（Getty Images圖片）</p><p>菲律賓首都馬尼拉去年2月發生中國籍女商人綁架案，支付高達約1,800萬披索（約205萬港元）贖金後獲釋。警方日前披露案件最新進展，綁匪竟是刑事偵查大隊8名現職警員，主謀為一名少校。少校近日因涉及另一宗持槍劫案落網，目前仍有5名警員在逃。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T12:43:49.873965+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T12:30:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T16:20:09.353344+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T12:37:25.613976+00:00","content_hash":"abef49df83e6a3235353f006c9f42cac4e10c3a73face5f0ef6ebc90c3e40f13","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}